  <p>The GPA Progression Delta (HSC minus Previous GPA) separates districts into two groups: those improving student trajectories (Rajshahi, Dhaka, Mymensingh, Barisal) and those where students decline relative to their baseline (Rangpur, Sylhet, Khulna, Chattogram). Notably, Rangpur has the lowest mean HSC result <em>and</em> the most negative delta (-0.057), indicating a system that is both low-performing and deteriorating.</p>

